{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Welcome to the grind, loser. We hope you brought snacks.</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in the mud. Broke. Confused. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten hours later you're running a hyper-optimized mining empire, yelling at your dog for wasting your IRL energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just an idle game \u2014 this is your new second job. Without pay. Without health insurance. But with dopamine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0 What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Progression:</strong> Every click matters. Every resource is earned. Regret is a mechanic. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Crafting Web:</strong> If it exists, you probably made it from twigs, dust, and trauma. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige Mechanics:</strong> Reset. Profit. Repeat. Classic, but evil. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling Like a Maniac:</strong> Soft caps. Hard caps. Emotional caps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle, Not Dead:</strong> Plays in the background\u2026 until you blink and it\u2019s 3:27\u202fAM. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low System Impact:</strong> Runs on a potato. Destroys your soul, not your CPU.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udeab What\u2019s NOT included:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No loot boxes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fake &quot;idle&quot; systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No blockchain garbage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Built for people who:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reboot runs over 0.01% inefficiency </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read patch notes for fun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize their grandma's garden </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think numbers &gt; feelings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Totally real reviews:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Missed my grandma\u2019s birthday. She understands.&quot; \u2013 Tim, 42 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game taught me math. Then punished me for it.&quot; \u2013 Former Valedictorian </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;96 hours in. No idea if I\u2019m having fun.&quot; \u2013 Person With No Face </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It runs on a toaster. I still overclocked it.&quot; \u2013 Linus (not that one) </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Final Notes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent updates </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New items &amp; quests added weekly </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck friendly (but not legally liable for addiction)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Your first Steps.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691210/e37065ed72d6824dfe2e08f4c38d6e292da19520.jpg"},{"name":"Lumberjack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691210/2bccd09129328607e05c9b6eba46c4e463661235.jpg"},{"name":"Get ready for the Anvil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2691210/54ec09bf49d4bbd8d5f66ec28f3e1d283acf6c13.jpg"},{"name":"Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/